cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MUIO 5.6 - Community Edition (HiGHS)"
abstract: >-
  A community edition of MUIO (Modelling User Interface for OSeMOSYS) with
  additional solver options, including HiGHS, for solving large OSeMOSYS and
  CLEWs models. It adds configurable HiGHS settings, live progress for each
  stage of a run, and a run summary recording the outcome, the objective value,
  the problem size and type, peak memory and stage times. The reported objective
  includes the fixed cost of existing capacity, which the exported matrix files
  do not carry. New results are published only when a run succeeds, with one
  previous copy kept. Solver output is converted to the format MUIO already reads,
  so results and visualisations are unchanged.
